0..75 Comment "// The iterated pair, twenty levels deep, in two spellings. Each level is a"
76..138 Comment "// record of two fields, and both fields hold the level below."
139..141 Comment "//"
142..221 Comment "// The unshared tree of the pair has 2^20 leaves, but the term has one node for"
222..299 Comment "// each level. A checker that walks each occurrence of a node walks the whole"
300..343 Comment "// tree, and it exceeds its step allowance."
344..346 Comment "//"
347..424 Comment "// The core checker keeps a goal memo for each run. It answers a goal that it"
425..499 Comment "// meets again in one step, so each spelling checks in steps linear in the"
500..577 Comment "// depth. The definition spine names each level by a declaration, and the let"
578..614 Comment "// spine binds each level to a name."
615..617 Comment "//"
618..672 Comment "// - see: #5719 — the goal memo of the core checker."
673..754 Comment "// - see: `crates/core-checker/src/judgement/memo.rs` — the key and the binders"
755..774 Comment "//   that it reads."
